# Outfit body (R18): light armour, an angular chest plate standing off the torso, three ab plates, big rounded steel
# pauldrons over both shoulders, accent spine stripe and a glowing status light.
# Torso inside x 1..7, y 2..10 (vest frame shifted 1 in y for the pauldrons; pivot 4 6 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_armour
grid 5
size 10 12 12
slot plate SwatchMain
slot steel Steel
slot stripe SwatchAccent
slot light SwatchGlow
shell 0 1 1 8 11 10 1 plate
carve box 1 2 1 7 10 9
carve box 2 4 9 6 8 10
poly 6 10 plate 7,2 9,1 10,3 10,9 9,11 7,10
box 8 3 1 9 9 2 plate
box 8 3 3 9 9 4 plate
box 8 3 5 9 9 6 plate
ellipsoid 4 2 9.6 3.6 2 1.8 steel
ellipsoid 4 10 9.6 3.6 2 1.8 steel
carve box 1 2 8 7 10 10
paint box 9 5 6 10 7 10 stripe
box 9 2 8 10 3 9 light
box 0 1 0 8 11 1 steel
pivot 4 6 0
